<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><font face="arial">I’m excited that you are ready to begin your studies at Arizona State University in the <a href="http://www.thunderbird.edu/bachelor-global-management">Bachelor of Global Management program</a>. This email summarizes our earlier conversation with the highlights of your new program.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">As I explained when we talked, the BGM program will provide you with the core skills you’ll need to start a career in international business, prepare you to become proficient in a foreign language, and help you understand the cultural aspects of regions across the world.&nbsp;</font></div><div><br></div><div><font face="arial">An exciting aspect of the program includes a required international internship, allowing you to take language and culture courses at a host institution at your internship destination or online through ASU.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">As part of the professional development plan, you’ll develop an online portfolio to showcase your global management skills, qualities and work experience for potential employers to review.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Finally, there will be exclusive housing for you with networking opportunities and engaging student activities.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">&lt;Customized paragraph by admission representative&gt;</b>. If you have any questions, please contact Anna Calloway at Anna.Calloway@asu.edu.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We look forward to having you at this exciting new program!</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,&nbsp;</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>